DESCRIPTION:BOSSAJAZZFESTIVAL 2026 – August 7 &amp\; 8<br><br>Day 1 – 
 August 7<br><br>Theme: Acoustic jazz\, Brazilian rhythm\, and vinyl groove
 s – a journey through the Afro‑Latin diaspora.<br><br>19:00 – 19:45 
 | TWO FOUR TRIO Jazz Trio<br>Acoustic jazz featuring Pierre Nilson (piano)
 \, Ölme Jakob Ulmestrand (double bass)\, and Jan Heidenberg (drums).<br><
 br>20:00 – 20:45 | TWO FOUR TRIO Jazz Trio<br>Acoustic jazz featuring Pi
 erre Nilson (piano)\, Ölme Jakob Ulmestrand (double bass)\, and Jan Heide
 nberg (drums) with special guests Dzakali (vocals\, guitar) and Sergio Mac
