 ira show with Cromadinho<br>Traditional roda with live berimbau\, pandeiro
 \, singing\, dance\, and Brazilian percussion.<br><br>19:00 – 19:45 | Br
 az Lima &amp\; Laura Mardlleen<br>Acoustic guitar and vocal bossa nova.<br
 ><br>20:00 – 20:45 |TWO FOUR TRIO Jazz Trio featuring Pille Rite Rei<br>
 Jazz\, samba\, and bossa nova – the trio (Pierre Nilson\, Ölme Jakob Ul
 mestrand\, Jan Heidenberg) joined by Pille Rite Rei on saxophone and vocal
 s.<br><br>21:00 – 21:45 | Grande Finale (Collaboration)<br>All artists u
 nite: Braz Lima\, Laura Madlleen\, Pille Rite Rei\, the trio (Pierre Nilso
 n\, Ölme Jakob Ulmestrand\, Jan Heidenberg)\, and Cromadinho – a collec
 tive celebration of Afro‑Brazilian music.<br><br>22:00 – late | Afterp
 arty<br>Music continues – open dancefloor for everyone.<br><br>General a
 dmission:<br>Day 1 (August 7) – €25<br>Day 2 (August 8) – €35<br>F
 ull Festival Pass (both days) – €50<br><br>Student and retired discoun
 t:<br>Day 1 (August 7) – €20<br>Day 2 (August 8) – €30<br>Full Fes
