  four musicians from Sweden and Finland reunite in Helsinki for a new coll
 aboration.\n\nThe Nordic Intervention was formed by musicians who first me
 t while studying at the Royal College of Music in Stockholm. Their reperto
 ire brings together original compositions and selected jazz classics from 
 the 1950s and 60s\, with the clarinet taking the lead.\n\nThe Nordic Inter
 vention is:\nHannibal Jarrah\, clarinet\nNoah Hjulström\, piano\nDario Fa
 ntuzzi\, bass\nKnut Haglund\, drums\n\nFree entry.
